  #line-at(90.024pt, 443.11pt, "several representative multilayer systems and thermoreflectance modalities, these ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 459.43pt, "coordinates are approximately Gaussian even when the original physical parameters are ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 475.75pt, "skewed. Performing covariance-based propagation in the transformed space and ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 492.07pt, "mapping the results back to physical parameters yields asymmetric confidence intervals ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 508.39pt, "that closely match normalized MC benchmarks. The approach preserves the non-")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 524.59pt, "Gaussian uncertainty structure of the recovered parameters while avoiding repeated ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 540.94pt, "nonlinear refitting, providing a fast and physically interpretable methodology for ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 557.26pt, "thermoreflectance uncertainty quantification in multilayer systems governed by ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 573.58pt, "diffusive heat conduction. ")
